    fix: lazy-import multimodal classes + add torchvision to requirements
    
    Root cause: AutoModelForMultimodalLM and AutoProcessor trigger
    transformers.image_processing_utils at import time, which imports
    torchvision.transforms.v2.functional — a module the minimal stub
    cannot replicate.
    
    Fix 1: Move AutoModelForMultimodalLM and AutoProcessor to lazy
    imports inside load_model(), so the module loads cleanly even
    without torchvision.
    
    Fix 2: Add torchvision>=0.22.0 to requirements-colab.txt so
    the real package gets installed during the dependency phase.

